{
  "borough": "Harrow",
  "application_type": "All Other",
  "decision": "Refused",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNoSpacing&quot;&gt;The &lt;span class=&quot;ui-provider&quot;&gt;proposed development, by\r\nreason of its visual appearance and design would disrupt the street scene\r\ncreating a development at odds and out of keeping with the prevailing character\r\nand elevational proportions on Kenton Road. The building would fail to\r\nsatisfactorily integrate with its surroundings and thereby detrimental to the\r\ncharacter and appearance of the adjacent Town Centre and prominent position on\r\na busy thoroughfare. The proposal is therefore contrary to the design\r\nobjectives as set out in the National Planning Policy Framework (2023); Polices\r\nD3 and D4 of the London Plan (2021), policy CS 1 B of the harrow Core Strategy\r\n(2012) and policies DM 1 of the Harrow Development Management Policies\r\n(2013).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNoSpacing&quot;&gt;The proposed development, by reason of its considerable bulk\r\nand massing would result in a harmful impact to the light and outlook of the\r\nadjacent dwellinghouse at no. 230 Kenton would be detrimental to the amenities\r\nand quality of life of those residents. &lt;span class=&quot;ui-provider&quot;&gt;The proposal is\r\ntherefore contrary to the National Planning Policy Framework (2023); Polices D3\r\nof the London Plan (2021), policy CS 1 B of the harrow Core Strategy (2012) and\r\npolicies DM 1 of the Harrow Development Management Policies (2013).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
